  "mechanism_class": "structural",
  "mechanism_rationale": "empf-v5 passed all 12 non-word counted Tier 1 gates and passed every completed metric check on five_word_joint_smoke through step 17,501/20,001, hitting only the 900s wall-time cap (INCOMPLETE) under concurrent multi-agent GPU sharing because 2D dense nn.Linear layers still invoked 9 serial cuSOLVER SVD calls per step (180,009 over 20,001 steps). Exposing DualNorm's guarded cubic Newton-Schulz regularized polar solver as optimizer_dense_profile = 'newton_schulz_v1' computes the same smoothed polar operator s / hypot(s, smoothing) via CUDA-graphed GEMMs (matching polar_factor to ~1e-5 relative error with 1e-3 residual guards and exact polar_factor fallback), eliminating cuSOLVER contention on MLP/joint-discrete tasks while preserving empf-v5's continuous stability, shift recovery, and multimodal hold dynamics.",
